# Store every file byte-for-byte; never normalise line endings.
#
# agents/*.py double as data files: AgentRegistry.save_system_prompt rewrites their
# prompt constants in place at runtime. Letting git convert line endings on checkout
# would make those files appear modified for reasons unrelated to the app, and would
# risk the regex patching in orchestration/prompt_editor.py not matching what it
# wrote. Keeping the worktree and the index byte-identical avoids both.
* -text
